<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="e4a66d9c-b160-5e80-ba5b-b2f38aac8dac" name="XII Legion World Eaters - Campaign" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="86405571-5289-597b-b308-a9a2d68c00b9" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false">
 <readme>XII Legion World Eaters - Campaign

The campaign version of this Legion's fleet. Every ship carries its own Campaign Record: Veteran Level, Battle Honours (maximum four, +5 pts each) and Battle Scars (no limit, −5 pts each).

Use this catalogue for Great Crusade campaign play. For a normal game use the standard catalogue of the same name instead — the two are separate systems and should not be mixed in one roster.

Full rules: campaign/GREAT-CRUSADE-CAMPAIGN.md</readme><selectionEntries>
 <selectionEntry id="598fb46e-ae3c-56b7-b2da-28480f8e3c25" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="ae242e03-4b0f-576a-ab2b-85b39afc2bf5" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="57b10daa-e368-5169-ba3a-c133974f1457" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">7</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="7ec3156d-9238-5f8f-861e-9a031856ee81" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="aa131488-3b57-5cc6-b86a-fea82b3d5639" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Ordnance: 3 · Dorsal: 3 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="852f7012-b50c-52a0-b8b3-530fe847052c" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a76ca72c-6510-56f4-b845-e3a30e050a0f" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 7 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow Ordnance 3 · Dorsal 3 · Defence 6 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="c628135d-690d-522c-a1b2-72d267929b2d" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="148611a1-a01d-5320-83b9-71decc869f3f" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="5369a410-6b4b-5d8b-930c-7b18f2bb7e06" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="c5d4cfb8-56c3-5238-84a9-1718a00dc89f" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="a7d1e82b-e23a-5b06-8e93-b0d60a8923e9" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="a351d43e-b330-58c6-94cf-5eef5d2d7c79" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="9286fd0e-5506-5db7-9b25-3c46fbc7f6c3" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="9556fb31-4769-5db7-a81e-a922e812161a" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="7c4ca4f1-3617-5551-92f8-8fedd82cff8a" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="b7eb9670-e167-5ad8-83b6-62dbd4d7c86e" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="e63d0dc0-8a7e-536a-b787-4baa931f6c79" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="e763acda-119f-520e-82fc-36a977a41fdf" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="87d16672-670e-56c1-82d0-e854f21883ac" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
