 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Named Character. 2 Fleet Orders of each type each battle round. Practised Command: once per battle round, one friendly ship within Command range may re-roll a single failed Evade roll. Flagship may re-roll ram distance/effects; Ursus Claws force Break Away on 6+.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
